WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.087 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
This is the Watcher invitation, not a receipt.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:07.560 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
A browser return cannot confirm your trial or membership.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.261 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Sign in to the Whop account used

00:00:10.261 --> 00:00:12.963 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
at checkout and check its library first.

00:00:12.963 --> 00:00:15.664 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
When Whop confirms your access, the Realm

00:00:15.664 --> 00:00:18.365 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
introduces one new being in week one.

00:00:18.365 --> 00:00:20.680 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
In week two, the Process reveals

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.610 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
how the vision was made.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:25.697 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
In week three, the Records hold its story.

00:00:25.697 --> 00:00:28.398 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
These chapters form a twenty eight day

00:00:28.398 --> 00:00:31.099 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
cycle, and each has space to breathe.

00:00:31.099 --> 00:00:33.415 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
You can return to one being

00:00:33.415 --> 00:00:35.730 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
without rushing ahead to the next.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.847 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Week four brings the Session.

00:00:40.847 --> 00:00:44.172 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Check Whop for its live schedule and available rooms.

00:00:44.172 --> 00:00:46.758 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The monthly Watcher begins with seven days

00:00:46.758 --> 00:00:49.344 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
free, then costs twenty eight dollars every

00:00:49.344 --> 00:00:51.930 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
twenty eight days unless canceled through Whop.

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:53.777 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The annual choice is separate.

00:00:53.777 --> 00:00:56.732 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The seven night return window begins after the

00:00:56.732 --> 00:01:00.057 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
first payment, not on day one of the trial.

00:01:00.057 --> 00:01:03.751 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Your Whop receipt and library confirm your dates and access.

00:01:03.751 --> 00:01:05.968 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
If anything is missing, contact Numinous

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:08.554 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
support with your receipt and checkout email.

00:01:08.554 --> 00:01:11.140 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Never send a password or card details.
